================================================================================
ACADYK — FIRST TESTING PHASE & ACADEMIC ACKNOWLEDGEMENT
================================================================================

Acadyk is going live this week for its first testing phase within the
Department of Artificial Intelligence. This initial phase focuses on real student
interaction, feedback, and usability testing as we take our first step toward
building a stronger academic networking experience.

Mentorship & Guidance:
----------------------
The testing phase is conducted under the mentorship and guidance of:
  • Dr. Rajni Ranjan Makwana
  • Dr. Rahul Kumar Sharma

Whose expertise, support, and leadership help shape Acadyk into a meaningful
platform for students.

"The journey begins with our first users."
